   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Position vectors from the origin lie on}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{one line when a is parallel to b.}\\\\[5pt]&\\vec a=(2,-7),\\quad\\vec b=\\left(\\frac m2,\\,11\\right)\\end{aligned}\\]",
